  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 806.03 Transporter Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 806.03 Transporter Requirements. A transporter of hazardous waste fuel or hazardous waste that is used to produce a fuel shall be subject to Env-Hw 600.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #7578, eff 10-13-01; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12350, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14526, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
